references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Amazon PPC Benchmarks From One Real Account: 80% of Search Terms Never
      Produced an Order
    authors:
      - name: "RedHen Labs"
    url: "https://rrw-ads.com/blog/amazon-ppc-benchmarks"
    year: 2026
    abstract: >-
      Analysis of 4,088 distinct Amazon search terms across 120 days on one
      seller account. 80.3% of terms produced zero orders; 23.5% of ad spend went
      to terms that never produced an order; the top 50 terms (1.2%) produced
      57.1% of sales; 609 terms produced exactly one order while 132 reached
      three or more; top-of-search converted 29.7% at 31.3% ACoS versus product
      pages at 12.3% and 45.6%; break-even ACoS ranged 28.9%-67.1% across nine
      FBA products in one catalog.
